reviewTips.suggestion:
[重构思路] 与其他访问保持一致改用可选链，并把 name/value 一起判空。代码示例：
```ts
const submitterName = event.submitter?.getAttribute('name');
const submitterValue = event.submitter?.getAttribute('value');
if (submitterName && submitterValue) {
  formData.append(submitterName, submitterValue);
}
```

[重构思路] 若因其他原因（如改用别的注入机制）才删除，应在 MR 中给出替代机制并同步更新注释/issue；否则恢复该响应头。代码示例：
```csharp
OnPrepareResponse = fileContext =>
{
    // Avoid caching index.html during development (hot reload injects a script).
    fileContext.Context.Response.Headers[HeaderNames.CacheControl] = "no-store";
    if (applyCopHeaders) { /* ... */ }
}
```

[重构思路] 删除该属性；若确有后续需要，改为在有使用点的 PR 中加入并附 TODO/说明，或改为在需要处通过 `[Inject]` 局部获取。代码示例：
```csharp
// 删除：
// [Inject]
// private NavigationManager NavigationManager { get; set; }
```

[重构思路] 用 try/finally 包裹写入逻辑。代码示例：
```csharp
var purposeLengthsPool = ArrayPool<int>.Shared.Rent(purposes.Length);
try
{
    // 计算长度并写入 targetArr ...
}
finally
{
    ArrayPool<int>.Shared.Return(purposeLengthsPool);
}
```
